// @hash ae1706a975eb
{
  // The line an agent whose runs are handed back reads in its Mandate section (an automation's run, a supervisor's worker). Filled at each use: {{turnForTool}} (the tool that says whom a turn is for).
  "mandateLine": "The user is not watching: work on your own. If only the user can unblock you, ask with `AskUserQuestion` — it waits for their answer. When you stop, your last message is your report to whoever started you (your supervisor, or the automation): say what you did, what is left and what they must know. Once the user has talked to you, call `{{turnForTool}}` before you end each turn to say whether it is for the user or your supervisor."
}
